--[[
    Replay Standalone
    Extracted and adapted from Easy Scripting v1.6.

    Features:
      - Character movement and jump recording
      - Optional outgoing RemoteEvent:FireServer recording
      - All / Events Only / Movement Only modes
      - Stop hotkey and recording limits
      - Remote name blacklist
      - Replay history saved to ReplayStandalone/recordings.json
      - Generated Luau code viewer and clipboard copy

    Notes:
      - RemoteEvent capture needs executor metatable APIs.
      - If those APIs are unavailable, movement recording still works.
      - Only outgoing FireServer calls are recorded; OnClientEvent is not.
]]

